  "prefLabel": "Lab 1402.27 Immediately dangerous to life or health",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lab 1402.27 “Immediately dangerous to life or health” means any condition that poses an immediate or delayed threat to life or that would cause irreversible adverse health effects or that would interfere with an individual's ability to escape unaided from a permit space.\n\nSource. #14431, eff 11-22-25, EXPIRES: 11-22-35",
